    |      |                      You returned home with the Bone Crown.                     |      |                     The nightmares began on the first night.                    |      |               By the seventh, they no longer felt like nightmares.              |      |                             They felt like memories.                            |      |                                                                                 |    _ |                                                                                 |   / \|                                                                                 |  | @ |                                                                                 |   \_/__________________________________________________________________________________/     ___________________________________________________________________________________    / \                                                                                  \  | @ | '||''|.    ..|''||   '|.   '|' '||''''|  '||'  |'  '||''''|  '||''''|  '||''|.  |   \_/|  ||   ||  .|'    ||   |'|   |   ||  .     || .'     ||  .     ||  .     ||   || |      |  ||'''|.  ||      ||  | '|. |   ||''|     ||'|.     ||''|     ||''|     ||...|' |      |  ||    || '|.     ||  |   |||   ||        ||  ||    ||        ||        ||      |      | .||...|'   ''|...|'  .|.   '|  .||.....| .||.  ||. .||.....| .||.....| .||.     |      |                                                                                 |      |                             Completed on this day by                            |      |                                                                                 |      |                                                                                 |      |                                                                                 |      |  who zonked       Zombies, shattered       Skeletons and vapourised the Vampire |      |                                                                                 |      |                                                                                 |      |                                                                                 |      |                     garnered       Gold, taking       turns.                    |      |                                                                                 |      |                    The Bone Crown whispered while you slept.                    |      |                             At first, you resisted.                             |      |                            Then you began to answer.                            |      |                         Soon, it stopped needing to ask.                        |      |                                                                                 |    _ |                                                                                 |   / \|                                                                                 |  | @ |                                                                                 |   \_/__________________________________________________________________________________/     ___________________________________________________________________________________    / \                                                                                  \  | @ | '||''|.    ..|''||   '|.   '|' '||''''|  '||'  |'  '||''''|  '||''''|  '||''|.  |   \_/|  ||   ||  .|'    ||   |'|   |   ||  .     || .'     ||  .     ||  .     ||   || |      |  ||'''|.  ||      ||  | '|. |   ||''|     ||'|.     ||''|     ||''|     ||...|' |      |  ||    || '|.     ||  |   |||   ||        ||  ||    ||        ||        ||      |      | .||...|'   ''|...|'  .|.   '|  .||.....| .||.  ||. .||.....| .||.....| .||.     |      |                                                                                 |      |                             Completed on this day by                            |      |                                                                                 |      |                                                                                 |      |                                                                                 |      |  who zonked       Zombies, shattered       Skeletons and vapourised the Vampire |      |                                                                                 |      |                                                                                 |      |                                                                                 |      |                     garnered       Gold, taking       turns.                    |      |                                                                                 |      |                  You swore the Bone Crown would never rule you.                 |      |               Day by day, that promise became harder to remember.               |      |                      Your reflection still looked the same.                     |      |                                The eyes did not.                                |      |                                                                                 |    _ |                                                                                 |   / \|                                                                                 |  | @ |                                                                                 |   \_/__________________________________________________________________________________/     ___________________________________________________________________________________    / \                                                                                  \  | @ | '||''|.    ..|''||   '|.   '|' '||''''|  '||'  |'  '||''''|  '||''''|  '||''|.  |   \_/|  ||   ||  .|'    ||   |'|   |   ||  .     || .'     ||  .     ||  .     ||   || |      |  ||'''|.  ||      ||  | 