                   |      |                       The Bone Crown brought you victory.                       |      |                           Then power. Then certainty.                           |      |                 Before long, you no longer asked what was right.                |      |                               Only what was yours.                              |      |                                                                                 |    _ |                                                                                 |   / \|                                                                                 |  | @ |                                                                                 |   \_/__________________________________________________________________________________/     ___________________________________________________________________________________    / \                                                                                  \  | @ | '||''|.    ..|''||   '|.   '|' '||''''|  '||'  |'  '||''''|  '||''''|  '||''|.  |   \_/|  ||   ||  .|'    ||   |'|   |   ||  .     || .'     ||  .     ||  .     ||   || |      |  ||'''|.  ||      ||  | '|. |   ||''|     ||'|.     ||''|     ||''|     ||...|' |      |  ||    || '|.     ||  |   |||   ||        ||  ||    ||        ||        ||      |      | .||...|'   ''|...|'  .|.   '|  .||.....| .||.  ||. .||.....| .||.....| .||.     |      |                                                                                 |      |                             Completed on this day by                            |      |                                                                                 |      |                                                                                 |      |                                                                                 |      |  who zonked       Zombies, shattered       Skeletons and vapourised the Vampire |      |                                                                                 |      |                                                                                 |      |                                                                                 |      |                     garnered       Gold, taking       turns.                    |      |                                                                                 |      |                  You hid the Bone Crown and tried to forget it.                 |      |                 Yet each night you woke closer to where it lay.                 |      |                        One morning, it was on your head.                        |      |                     You could not remember putting it there.                    |      |                                                                                 |    _ |                                                                                 |   / \|                                                                                 |  | @ |                                                                                 |   \_/__________________________________________________________________________________/     ___________________________________________________________________________________    / \                                                                                  \  | @ | '||''|.    ..|''||   '|.   '|' '||''''|  '||'  |'  '||''''|  '||''''|  '||''|.  |   \_/|  ||   ||  .|'    ||   |'|   |   ||  .     || .'     ||  .     ||  .     ||   || |      |  ||'''|.  ||      ||  | '|. |   ||''|     ||'|.     ||''|     ||''|     ||...|' |      |  ||    || '|.     ||  |   |||   ||        ||  ||    ||        ||        ||      |      | .||...|'   ''|...|'  .|.   '|  .||.....| .||.  ||. .||.....| .||.....| .||.     |      |                                                                                 |      |                             Completed on this day by                            |      |                                                                                 |      |                                                                                 |      |                                                                                 |      |  who zonked       Zombies, shattered       Skeletons and vapourised the Vampire |      |                                                                                 |      |                                                                                 |      |                                                                                 |      |                     garnered       Gold, taking       turns.                    |      |                                                                                 |      |                   The Crown's voice grew clearer every night.                   |      |                           Your own voice grew quieter.                          |      |                    One day, the two became indistinguishable.                   |      |                         After that, there was only one.                         |      |                                                                                 |    _ |                                                                                 |   / \|                                                                                 |  | @ |                                                                                 |   \_/__________________________________________________________________________________/     ___________________________________________________________________________________    / \                                                                                  \  | @ | '||''|.    ..|''||   '|.   '|' '||''''|  '||'  |'  '||''''|  '||''''|  '||''|.  |   \_/|  ||   ||  .|'    ||   |'|   |   ||  .     || .'     ||  .     ||  .     ||   || |      |  ||'''|. 